### Bingo Backend API - Test File
### Usa con la extensión REST Client de VS Code

### ======================================
### BINGOS - Gestión
### ======================================

### 1. Listar todos los bingos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Listar bingos con paginación
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos?page=1&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Listar bingos con filtro por estado
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos?status=ACTIVE
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Obtener un bingo específico
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Crear un nuevo bingo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bingos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bingo Año Nuevo 2027",
  "description": "Bingo especial de Año Nuevo",
  "drawDate": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "price": 15000,
  "status": "DRAFT"
}

### 6. Actualizar un bingo
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "price": 12000
}

### 7. Eliminar un bingo (cuidado!)
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ======================================
### CARTONES - Gestión
### ======================================

### 8. Listar cartones de un bingo
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}/cards
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Listar cartones con paginación
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}/cards?page=1&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Listar cartones solo DISPONIBLES
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}/cards?status=AVAILABLE
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Buscar cartones por número
@bingoId = cmubycgbx00008liz1o86qg4m
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bingos/{{bingoId}}/cards?search=14600001
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Obtener un cartón específico
@cardId = cmubycgc900028liz9uih26m3
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cards/{{cardId}}
Content-Type: application/json

